  "steps": [
    "Pressure-cook the toor dal and moong dal with turmeric, salt and 3 cups of water for 4 whistles, then mash lightly.",
    "Blanch the spinach in boiling water for 1 minute, drain and chop it roughly.",
    "Heat the oil, add cumin seeds and garlic and fry until the garlic is golden.",
    "Add the onion and green chilli and cook until soft, then add the tomato and chilli powder and cook until pulpy.",
    "Add the spinach and cook for 2 minutes, then pour in the dal and simmer for 8 minutes.",
    "Finish with lemon juice and adjust salt before serving."
  ]
